## Summary

Injected `data-semtag-*` hints across every screen of the JobBoard app (WebTestBench_0003), per `hint-design.md`.

**Screens/components annotated:**
- **`components/layout/Header.tsx`** — global nav (logo, jobs link, employer dashboard/post-job links)
- **`pages/Index.tsx` + `components/jobs/JobFilters.tsx` + `components/jobs/JobCard.tsx`** — job listing/search screen: filter selects (industry/location/type) with `data-semtag-options`, search input, results collection, count/empty observables, per-card fields (title link, industry/type/location/salary)
- **`pages/JobDetail.tsx` + `components/jobs/ApplicationForm.tsx`** — job detail screen: observable fields (title, company, location, salary, posted date, description, skills collection), application form region/inputs/submit
- **`pages/employer/Dashboard.tsx`** — employer dashboard: stats observables, jobs collection with per-job toggle/delete-dialog controls, nested applications sub-collection
- **`pages/employer/PostJob.tsx`** — post-job form: all inputs, three selects (industry/employment-type/location) with options, dynamic skills collection with add/remove
- **`pages/NotFound.tsx`** — "Return to Home" navigation link

**Id namespaces introduced:** `nav.*`, `jobs.grid.*` / `jobs.filters.*`, `job.detail.*`, `dashboard.*` (with `dashboard.jobs.item.<id>` and nested `.applications.item.<id>`), `post-job.*`, `notfound.*`.

**Collections folded:** `jobs.grid`, `job.detail.skills`, `dashboard.jobs` (+ nested `.applications`), `post-job.skills` — all verified by reading the code to confirm the container div is a direct ancestor of the `.map()`-rendered items, and that template-literal ids stay unique (scoped by `job.id`/`app.id`/`slugify(skill)`, and namespaced per-page so `jobs.grid.item.*` vs `dashboard.jobs.item.*` never collide even for the same underlying job).

**Deliberately left unhinted:** the marketing hero stats on `Index.tsx` (decorative, non-interactive, non-observable business state), and the truncated skill-preview badges on `JobCard` (first 4 skills + "+N more" — a decorative summary duplicating the authoritative skills list already hinted on `JobDetail`).

**Validation:**
- Ran the bundled validator against the full `src/` tree: **74 hinted elements across 69 files, 0 errors, 0 warnings, 0 info**.
- Ran `npm install`, `npm run build` — succeeds (pre-existing unrelated CSS `@import`-order warning only).
- Ran `npm run lint` — 4 errors / 8 warnings, all confirmed pre-existing via `git diff --stat` (in untouched files `command.tsx`, `textarea.tsx`, `tailwind.config.ts`, and a pre-existing `as any` in `PostJob.tsx` outside my diff) — no new lint issues introduced by the hint injection.
- `git diff --stat` confirms only the 9 files I intentionally edited changed, nothing else.

